// 503:7
[description01]
type=text
x=44
y=172
width=206
height=116
textfont=b12_full
text=Making a clockwork toy is very simple and a good place to start for new crafters. Simply create a clockwork mechanism on your Crafting table, then use it and a wood plank to make a toy soldier or a doll. Wind them up and watch them go!
colour=0x534a41

